      "content": "The truth is that while the world around you may feel irrevocably lost, *you* are still here, and that is a point worth protecting. Even after the grand chapters close, there can be new, small narratives beginning, even if the horizon looks empty now. Letting go of the struggle does not have to mean letting go of life itself; it can mean finding a gentler way to bear the weight. Please, let me help you find one tiny reason to stay with me for just a little while longer.",
